{"id":"0ec3908763541719","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive.md","title":"df-rewrite-relation-transitive","display":"df-rewrite-relation-transitive","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]"],"label":"56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive","aliases":["56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive"],"display":"df-rewrite-relation-transitive","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rewrite-relation-transitive"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-rewrite-relation-transitive\"><code>df-rewrite-relation-transitive</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，关系幂 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^{\\,n}\">\\(\\to_R^{\\,n}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^{+}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\to_R^{\\,n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R^{+}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\to_R^{\\,n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_R^{+}t\\iff(s,t)\\in\\to_R^{+}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_R^{+}t\\iff(s,t)\\in\\to_R^{+}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^{*}=\\to_R^{+}\\cup\\{(t,t)\\mid t\\in T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R^{*}=\\to_R^{+}\\cup\\{(t,t)\\mid t\\in T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>加号要求至少一步，不排除循环带来的 (t,t) 边；与星号的区别是允许的路径长度。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，记号1.1.3及§2.3，印刷第8、38页，OCR页块29、59。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-rewrite-relation-transitive","text":"`df-rewrite-relation-transitive`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，关系幂 $\\to_R^{\\,n}$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T